      "description": "A selected real destination in the left administrator navigation.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Decisions\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#review-queue\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-nav-label\">Review queue</span><span class=\"ds-nav-count\">685</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:'Poppins',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;padding:12px;background:var(--ax-surface,#fff)}.ds-nav-link{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;height:36px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:var(--ax-radius,8px);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;background:var(--ax-brand,#001c77);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s,color .15s}.ds-nav-link>svg{color:var(--ax-teal,#00c6c1)}.ds-nav-label{flex:1}.ds-nav-count{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:18px;padding:0 7px;border:1px solid var(--ax-teal,#00c6c1);border-radius:6px;background:var(--ax-teal,#00c6c1);color:var(--ax-brand,#001c77)}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ax-brand,#001c77);outline-offset:2px}"
